    "name": "📌 Reflection AI API",
    "description": "### About\n\n\"Make intelligence open and accessible to all.\"\n\nReflection builds its own open-weight Beam models and serves them through an OpenAI-compatible API (Chat Completions and Models). On the workspace overview it is listed under **Model makers**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- Reflection Account: [https://reflection.ai/](https://reflection.ai/)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `reflection_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:reflection_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://developers.reflection.ai/api-reference/overview](https://developers.reflection.ai/api-reference/overview)\n    \n- Models: [https://developers.reflection.ai/models](https://developers.reflection.ai/models)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
